Package: kesher-node
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: KesherCom <https://github.com/KesherCom/kesher>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), libasound2 | libasound2t64, libopus0, adduser
Recommends: iw
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/KesherCom/kesher
Description: Kesher intercom node (headless station)
 Joins a Kesher intercom server as a station with a USB headset or sound
 card: low-latency Opus over UDP, talk button and LED on GPIO.
 Configure /etc/kesher/node.toml, then: sudo systemctl restart kesher-node
